{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38425","headline":"玉堂种竹六韵 · 吴融","name":"玉堂种竹六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当砌植檀栾，浓阴五月寒。\n引风穿玉牖，摇露滴金盘。\n有韵和宫漏，无香杂畹兰。\n地疑云鏁易，日近雪封难。\n静称围棋会，闲宜阁笔看。\n他年终结实，不羡树栖鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}